Embarking on yet another journey to slaughter a hapless ranger, this game
has actually been doing quite well. Level 4 had the bones files from *two*
wizards on it, so I have no shortage of CoMR, and one of the wizards had a
BoH. Everything was cursed, but after a few water prayers with giant piles
of cursed stuff in my inventory, good ole Venus gave a pass-through and
uncursed a lot of it. Managed to get a blessed identify to hit most of my
inventory, and I was level 13 before I even hit level 8 of the main
dungeon.

The RNG decided to mock me, putting a BoH in Sokoban, and *2* in the lower
mines. Really useful after finding a bones version...thanks a lot.

So anyway, I'm progressing down, just recently gobbled a wraith for level
14, sacrifices have netted me a Vorpal and Mjollnir. While on a search for
a nymph who stole from me and vanished (bitch had a wand of digging, so you
know what a nightmare THAT is, and she seems to be just completely
gone...fortunately she didn't steal anything too critical)...I went down
the stairs to DL17.

DL17 is completely dug out. It has some 30 random monsters in it, including
a titan and 2 dragons. The southeast corner has...by my quick
guestimate...80 black puddings. When I first went down, I thought that
maybe my game file had been corrupted and I was going to lose my character
to a trickery, until I took a more careful look at what was in the level.

I'm in favor of pudding farmers getting their just rewards, but damnit
Alphamale, why could you not have been more careful? This is going to be a
complete nightmare. I hope you had good stuff. 



